since it has only $3$ coumns.\n\nAlso, the matrix must have $4$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $C$ has exactly $4$ pivot columns, while the matrix $A$ has only $2$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(C)=4$ and $\\text{rank}(A)=2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the matrix $C.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-34824/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d847ec9-c379-5013-ab77-a9b92dc8ca27"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-34824"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection/e432f1020975ada4c83798ae75bfd6c0ae4dfe63215763f08b8be8ccabf8a5d3" :answer/id #uuid "a658f27a-9238-5b6c-bfa0-ec003b81b3a8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" :answer/id #uuid "784c1e42-a455-5505-a90a-32b98c16d784" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25" :answer/id #uuid "a059649e-0946-5ace-82c1-c861d0f2a758" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" :answer/id #uuid "544cf9aa-6613-5ee6-876a-a49b7e303a87" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" :answer/id #uuid "32633251-4e69-5907-bc02-2bff1e665a12" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35283/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "71040354-bb33-5bf4-9502-3da975002088" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-35283/selection/e432f1020975ada4c83798ae75bfd6c0ae4dfe63